<title>USA: CBOT silver deliveries - Sept 24.</title>
<headline>CBOT silver deliveries - Sept 24.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against September silver futures for September 25 (In contracts).</p>
<p>Silver-1 - 2 lots. Oldest long - Sept 23, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - Merrill Lynch/c 2.</p>
<p>Stopped - 1st Option/c 2.</p>
<p>Delivery locations - 2 lots at Chicago (4002).</p>
<p>H=House account. C=customer account.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
